"c4.fig1.como1": "**Abstention rate** = (registered voters − turnout) ÷ registered voters, in each round, each with its own electorate. The change is the runoff rate minus the first-round rate, in percentage points.",
"c4.fig1.como2": "Example, Brazil: {a1} → {a2}, {da}",
