"c4.fig2.titulo": "In the {n} states where it could be estimated, most of the net change went to Lula in {l} and to Flávio in {f}",
"c4.fig2.titulo_sem_lado": "In the {n} states where it could be estimated, most of the net change went to Lula in {l} and to Flávio in {f}; in {s}, there was no clear side",
"c4.fig2.sub": "Where the net change in turnout went, by region and state (estimate, only where it could be estimated with confidence).",
"c4.fig2.leitura": "Out of every 100 additional votes cast, how many went, on net, to each candidate, comparing polling stations in the same city. Where turnout fell (↓), the bar splits the loss. It could be estimated with confidence in {reg} of the 5 regions and in {ufs} of the 27 states.",
"c4.fig2.leitura_aviso": " {marca} marks places the model does not describe well (some source of votes falls outside 0% to 100%): read the estimate with that caveat.",
