"c9.fig1.titulo": "The other candidates' votes did not tilt the same way: in the polling-station calculation, the net of Augusto Cury's tilted to Lula; the net of Ronaldo Caiado's, to Flávio",
"c9.fig1.sub": "Lula's and Flávio's shares of the votes from each source, on net, in Brazil, comparing polling stations in the same city. The mark on the bar is the 95% interval.",
"c9.fig1.leitura": "This applies to places, not people: it shows which way the runoff leaned in the polling stations where each candidate had more votes in the first round.",
"c9.fig1.eixo": {"t": "each candidate's share, %", "rotulo": 40},
"c9.fig1.grupo_cand": "Each candidate's first-round votes",
"c9.fig1.grupo_fontes": "The other sources, in the same calculation",
"c9.fig1.aria": "Split between Lula and Flávio of the votes of each of the other first-round candidates and of the two other sources, in Brazil",
"c9.fig1.fonte": "Source: TSE, results by polling station for both rounds ({sec} polling stations); our calculations.",
"c9.fig1.como1": "**The calculation **is the polling-station calculation from chapter 4 (polling stations in the same city, with municipality fixed effects and weighted by first-round registered voters), with the other candidates' votes split into four sources: Augusto Cury (Avante), Renan Santos (Missão), Ronaldo Caiado (PSD) and the other seven, combined. Lula's and Flávio's shares add up to 100% in each source. With the four in a single source, the calculation gives the same result as chapter 4.",
"c9.fig1.como2": "Interval: bootstrap with {n} replications, resampling whole states. The precision criterion is the one from chapter 4: an estimate between 0% and 100% and an interval of up to 10 points on each side.",
"c9.fig1.como3": "Robustness checks: unweighted; resampling municipalities within each state; without the polling stations that absorbed others (aggregated); without the polling stations where the number of registered voters changes by more than 5 between rounds. In Brazil, all four keep the reading for every source.",
"c9.como.script": "Record: the five questions of the first round of questions, with the test and what would count as a finding, before the calculations. Calculation: scripts/exploracao.py, which writes dados/exploracao.json.",
"c9.fig2.titulo": "Lula overtook Flávio in {fl} municipalities, {nuf} of them in {uf}; Flávio overtook Lula in {lf} ({ufslf})",
"c9.fig2.sub": "Municipalities where Flávio had more votes than Lula in the first round and Lula more than Flávio in the runoff, in the {n} states where this happened.",
"c9.fig2.leitura": "It is a count, with no model. The bars show one direction, Lula overtaking Flávio; the other, Flávio overtaking Lula, happened in {lf}, in {ufs}.",
"c9.fig2.eixo": {"t": "municipalities", "rotulo": 30},
