"c9.fig2.como2": "Robustness check: counting all first-round candidates, no other candidate came first in any municipality ({todos}).",
"c9.fig3.titulo": "In polling stations where Lula was stronger, abstention fell slightly more; where Flávio was stronger, slightly less",
"c9.fig3.sub": "Change in abstention, in percentage points, per 10 points more for Lula in the first-round two-candidate vote (that is, 10 fewer for Flávio), comparing polling stations in the same city.",
"c9.fig3.leitura": "Left of zero, abstention fell more in the polling stations where Lula was stronger. The difference is small: less than half a point between the top and the bottom quarter.",
"c9.fig3.eixo": {"t": "change in abstention per 10 points, pp", "rotulo": 56},
"c9.fig3.esq": {"t": "← fell more", "rotulo": 22},
"c9.fig3.dir": {"t": "fell less →", "rotulo": 22},
"c9.fig3.aria": "Coefficients with intervals: change in abstention per 10 points more for Lula, in Brazil and by region",
