"com.regras.3": "The artificial intelligence points out what may fall into one of these categories, and the author decides: release it, keep it hidden or reply; the reply appears marked “Reply from the author”. Meanwhile, the person who wrote it sees their own text, and other readers see only the notice, without the text. Reading is not immediate and may take a few hours: there is no need to send the comment again.",
