// ---------- External studies (estudos-externos.js; T13) ----------
"ee.intro": "Studies from other sources, published after the runoff, that look at the same change with data. Each one is compared, topic by topic, with what this study found: where it reaches the same result, where it differs, what it brings that this study did not look at, and what this study has that it does not. Studies from any side of the debate are included under the same criteria, and being listed does not mean this study agrees with them. The summaries are ours, in our own words; the original text is at each link.",
