"exp.ponte.intro": "The margin between the two went from {m1} in the first round to {m2} in the runoff. The waterfall adds up each region's part, or each state's.",
"exp.ponte.leitura": "The calculation starts at the first-round margin ({m1}) and adds each place's change up to the runoff margin ({m2}). Red bar: the margin moved toward Lula; blue, toward Flávio. Hover over or tap a bar to see the numbers.",
"exp.ponte.como1": "**Change in margin** = (Lula − Flávio in the runoff) − (Lula − Flávio in the first round), in votes, in each place. Added up, they give Brazil's change: {dm} votes.",
"exp.ponte.como2": "**Share of the reversal** = change in the place ÷ change in Brazil. The shares add up to 100%, including votes abroad.",
"exp.ponte.sub_reg": "Margin waterfall: the Lula − Flávio margin, in votes, from the first round to the runoff, summed region by region.",
"exp.ponte.sub_uf": "Margin waterfall: the Lula − Flávio margin, in votes, from the first round to the runoff, summed state by state.",
"exp.mapa.modo_ds": {"t": "Change in share", "rotulo": 24},
"exp.mapa.modo_da": {"t": "Change in abstention", "rotulo": 24},
"exp.mapa.titulo_s1": "In the first round, Lula had more votes than Flávio in {l} states; Flávio, in {f}",
"exp.mapa.titulo_s2": "In the runoff, Lula had more votes than Flávio in {l} states; Flávio, in {f}",
"exp.mapa.titulo_ds": "Lula's share rose and Flávio's fell in {onde}, by {min} to {max} points",
"exp.mapa.titulo_da": "Abstention fell in {caiu} states and rose in {subiu}",
"exp.mapa.sub_s1": "Each candidate's share of the two-candidate vote in the first round, by state: red where Lula had more votes, blue where Flávio did; the stronger the shade, the bigger the lead. Near 50% the shade is light, but the color shows who finished ahead.",
"exp.mapa.sub_s2": "Each candidate's share of the two-candidate vote in the runoff, by state: red where Lula had more votes, blue where Flávio did; the stronger the shade, the bigger the lead. Near 50% the shade is light, but the color shows who finished ahead.",
"exp.mapa.sub_ds": "Change in Lula's share of the two-candidate vote from the first round to the runoff, in percentage points; Flávio's is the same, with the opposite sign. The redder, the more Lula's share rose.",
"exp.mapa.sub_da": "Change in the abstention rate from the first round to the runoff, in percentage points. Darker: abstention rose more, or fell less; striped, the states where it rose. Without the candidates' colors, because abstention belongs to neither of them.",
