"exp.mapa.como1": "**Share** = the candidate's votes ÷ (Lula's votes + Flávio's votes), in each round. The scale runs from blue (Flávio with 80% of the two candidates' votes) to red (Lula with 80%), with light gray at a tie; above 80% the color does not change.",
"exp.mapa.como2": "**Change in share** = Lula's share in the runoff − in the first round, in percentage points. The scale goes up to 5 points either way.",
"exp.mapa.como3": "**Abstention rate** = (registered voters − turnout) ÷ registered voters, in each round, each with its own electorate; the scale runs from −4 to +8 points.",
