"csv.col.de_onde_vieram.meia_largura": "half the width of the 95% confidence interval, from 0 to 1",
"csv.col.de_onde_vieram.passa_criterio": "yes when it meets the precision criterion (at least 30 municipalities, estimate between 0 and 1 and half-width up to {lim}; HIPOTESES.md 4.2, in the order set in T32)",
"csv.col.de_onde_vieram.maior_parte": "who got the larger part, when it passes; the reason, when it does not (note N16)",
"csv.col.de_onde_vieram.intervalo": "what the bootstrap resampled: whole states (Brazil and regions) or whole municipalities, with all their polling stations (states)",
